; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR SORT  -  watch $FC PULSESORTXY sort twenty numbers   (VM1 @ $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Press any key to start. Twenty random numbers (1-60) appear as bars; each
; pass is ONE $FC PULSESORTXY opcode - a bubble-sort pass - and only the bars
; that moved are redrawn. When a pass finds nothing to swap it stops and shows
; how many passes it took. Then:  A sort up   D sort down   N new numbers   ESC (or Q) quit
;
; $FC PULSESORTXY ZD XY: one bubble pass over RX..RY (RY = the LAST element),
; Z = 0 up / 1 down, D = cell size in bytes. ExitCode $01 = something swapped,
; $00 = already in order, so a full sort is "pass, TESTEXIT 00, repeat".
; Measured on V0061.33: 160 random arrays (1- and 2-byte cells, both directions)
; identical to a Python bubble pass; full sorts take bubble sort's pass count.
; The first app to use $FC.
;
; VT100 only (reverse video, cursor addressing, erase-to-end-of-line). RAND is
; spun while it waits for the first key, so each run sorts different numbers.
; The pause between passes is the DLYI operand at $40A2 (now $06).
;
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-09-26 (Craig).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/sortvis_verify.py, V0061.33 image): the output is
; replayed into a VT100 screen and, after EVERY pass, the twenty bars must show
; exactly a Python bubble sort's state after that pass - up, down (D) and new numbers (N) sorts all match, pass for pass.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 224 STELLAR commands, $4000-$423E (575 bytes).  Arrays at $4900/$4940, the bar's
; run of spaces at $4A00, strings at $4B00.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START                              Start of program, and run the label pre-pass
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A                    Ten, for printing numbers
; D 4005 11 02 00 14    LOADXI R2 0014                     How many numbers
; D 4009 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video, clear the screen, hide the cursor
; D 400B CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 400D CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 400F CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 4011 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4013 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4015 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4017 CA 4A          SEROUTI 4A 'J'
; D 4019 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 401B CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 401D CA 3F          SEROUTI 3F '?'
; D 401F CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4021 CA 35          SEROUTI 35 '5'
; D 4023 CA 6C          SEROUTI 6C 'l'
; D 4025 11 0D 00 01    LOADXI R13 0001
; D 4029 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 402D BD 02 1D       CALL POSXY
; D 4030 11 0E 0B 00    LOADXI R14 0B00
; D 4034 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The title on line 1
; D 4036 11 0D 00 18    LOADXI R13 0018
; D 403A 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 403E BD 02 1D       CALL POSXY
; D 4041 11 0E 0B 41    LOADXI R14 0B41
; D 4045 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; SEED:
; D 4047 C3             RAND                               Spin the generator until a key comes - every run differs
; D 4048 CC             SERST
; D 4049 A1 00 47       IFFALSEI SEED
; D 404C CB             SERIN                              and throw the key away -
; D 404D 81 00 1B       TESTAI 001B
; D 4050 A1 00 61       IFFALSEI NEW                       unless it is a lone ESC
; D 4053 BD 01 92       CALL KWAIT
; D 4056 A1 01 6F       IFFALSEI QUIT
; D 4059 CB             SERIN                              an arrow (ESC [ x): its two bytes are thrown away
; D 405A BD 01 92       CALL KWAIT
; D 405D A1 00 61       IFFALSEI NEW
; D 4060 CB             SERIN
; NEW:
; D 4061 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; D 4065 11 07 00 3C    LOADXI R7 003C
; FILL:
; D 4069 C3             RAND
; D 406A 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 406C 4D 67          DIVXY R6 / R7                      RAND mod 60
; D 406E 27             COPYREMA
; D 406F 4E 00 01       ADDAI 0001                         + 1
; D 4072 2F 03 09 00    WRITEIDX R3 0900
; D 4076 42 03          INCX R3
; D 4078 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 407A A1 00 69       IFFALSEI FILL
; D 407D 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000                     Ascending
; SORT:
; D 4081 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000                     No passes yet
; D 4085 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; ALL:
; D 4089 BD 01 A7       CALL DRAWROW
; D 408C 42 03          INCX R3
; D 408E 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 4090 A1 00 89       IFFALSEI ALL
; D 4093 BD 01 F5       CALL STATUS
; PASS:
; D 4096 11 0D 09 00    LOADXI R13 0900
; D 409A 11 0E 09 40    LOADXI R14 0940
; D 409E 3B DE 14       COPYMXMY R13 R14 14                Keep the numbers as they were
; D 40A1 C0 06          DLYI 06                            The watching speed
; D 40A3 11 06 09 00    LOADXI R6 0900
; D 40A7 11 07 09 13    LOADXI R7 0913                     RX = first, RY = LAST element
; D 40AB 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 40AD A1 00 B6       IFFALSEI DOWN
; D 40B0 FC 01 67       PULSESORTXY up, bytes, R6..R7      ONE bubble pass, ascending
; D 40B3 B0 00 B9       GAL PASSED
; DOWN:
; D 40B6 FC 11 67       PULSESORTXY down, bytes, R6..R7    ONE bubble pass, descending
; PASSED:
; D 40B9 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 40BD 96 00          TESTEXIT 00                        ExitCode $00: nothing was swapped
; D 40BF A1 00 C6       IFFALSEI SWAPPED
; D 40C2 11 08 00 01    LOADXI R8 0001                     Remember it - drawing must not be what decides
; SWAPPED:
; D 40C6 42 01          INCX R1
; D 40C8 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000                     Redraw only the lines that changed
; CHG:
; D 40CC 2E 03 09 00    READIDX R3 0900
; D 40D0 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 40D2 2E 03 09 40    READIDX R3 0940
; D 40D6 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 40D8 87 67          TESTXY R6 = R7
; D 40DA A0 00 E0       IFTRUEI SAME
; D 40DD BD 01 A7       CALL DRAWROW
; SAME:
; D 40E0 42 03          INCX R3
; D 40E2 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 40E4 A1 00 CC       IFFALSEI CHG
; D 40E7 BD 01 F5       CALL STATUS
; D 40EA 8C 08          TESTXZ R8
; D 40EC A0 00 96       IFTRUEI PASS                       Something moved: another pass
; DONE:
; D 40EF 11 0E 0B 96    LOADXI R14 0B96
; D 40F3 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       Sorted
; D 40F5 11 0D 00 18    LOADXI R13 0018
; D 40F9 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 40FD BD 02 1D       CALL POSXY
; D 4100 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Clear the old prompt
; D 4102 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4104 CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 4106 11 0E 0B 59    LOADXI R14 0B59
; D 410A C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; KEY:
; D 410C CB             SERIN                              Wait for a key (other VMs keep running)
; D 410D 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 410F 86 06 00 1B    TESTXI R6 001B
; D 4113 A1 01 26       IFFALSEI KEYL
; D 4116 BD 01 92       CALL KWAIT                         ESC: an arrow following?
; D 4119 A1 01 6F       IFFALSEI QUIT                      no: ESC on its own quits
; KESC:
; D 411C CB             SERIN                              yes: the rest of it is thrown away
; D 411D BD 01 92       CALL KWAIT
; D 4120 A0 01 1C       IFTRUEI KESC
; D 4123 B0 01 0C       GAL KEY
; KEYL:
; D 4126 86 06 00 71    TESTXI R6 0071
; D 412A A0 01 6F       IFTRUEI QUIT
; D 412D 86 06 00 51    TESTXI R6 0051
; D 4131 A0 01 6F       IFTRUEI QUIT
; D 4134 86 06 00 61    TESTXI R6 0061
; D 4138 A0 01 61       IFTRUEI UP
; D 413B 86 06 00 41    TESTXI R6 0041
; D 413F A0 01 61       IFTRUEI UP
; D 4142 86 06 00 64    TESTXI R6 0064
; D 4146 A0 01 68       IFTRUEI DN
; D 4149 86 06 00 44    TESTXI R6 0044
; D 414D A0 01 68       IFTRUEI DN
; D 4150 86 06 00 6E    TESTXI R6 006E
; D 4154 A0 00 61       IFTRUEI NEW
; D 4157 86 06 00 4E    TESTXI R6 004E
; D 415B A0 00 61       IFTRUEI NEW
; D 415E B0 01 0C       GAL KEY
; UP:
; D 4161 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000
; D 4165 B0 00 81       GAL SORT
; DN:
; D 4168 11 05 00 01    LOADXI R5 0001
; D 416C B0 00 81       GAL SORT
; QUIT:
; D 416F CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video, cursor back, clear, home
; D 4171 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4173 CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 4175 CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 4177 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4179 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 417B CA 3F          SEROUTI 3F '?'
; D 417D CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 417F CA 35          SEROUTI 35 '5'
; D 4181 CA 68          SEROUTI 68 'h'
; D 4183 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4185 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4187 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4189 CA 4A          SEROUTI 4A 'J'
; D 418B CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 418D CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 418F CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 4191 00             HALT
; KWAIT:
; D 4192 11 07 00 08    LOADXI R7 0008
; KWAIT1:
; D 4196 CC             SERST
; D 4197 A0 01 A2       IFTRUEI KWAIT2
; D 419A 43 07          DECX R7
; D 419C 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 419E A1 01 96       IFFALSEI KWAIT1
; D 41A1 CC             SERST                              Test false: nothing came
; KWAIT2:
; D 41A2 BE 00          RETURN
; D 41A4 F0 00 00       BREAK                              End of program
; DRAWROW:
; D 41A7 23 00 3D       COPYXY R3 -> R13
; D 41AA 52 0D 00 03    ADDXI R13 0003                     screen line
; D 41AE 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 41B2 BD 02 1D       CALL POSXY
; D 41B5 2E 03 09 00    READIDX R3 0900
; D 41B9 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4                   R4 = the value
; D 41BB 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 41BD 25             COPYMAA
; D 41BE 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41C1 C9             SEROUT                             tens
; D 41C2 27             COPYREMA
; D 41C3 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41C6 C9             SEROUT                             units
; D 41C7 CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 41C9 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Reverse video: a space is a block
; D 41CB CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41CD CA 37          SEROUTI 37 '7'
; D 41CF CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 41D1 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 41D4 2F 04 0A 00    WRITEIDX R4 0A00                   Cut the run of spaces to the value
; D 41D8 11 0E 0A 00    LOADXI R14 0A00
; D 41DC C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       the bar
; D 41DE 10 00 20       LOADAI 0020
; D 41E1 2F 04 0A 00    WRITEIDX R4 0A00                   and mend it
; D 41E5 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video; erase what the old bar left
; D 41E7 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41E9 CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 41EB CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 41ED CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 41EF CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41F1 CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 41F3 BE 00          RETURN
; STATUS:
; D 41F5 11 0D 00 17    LOADXI R13 0017
; D 41F9 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 41FD BD 02 1D       CALL POSXY
; D 4200 11 0E 0B 90    LOADXI R14 0B90
; D 4204 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4206 23 00 14       COPYXY R1 -> R4
; D 4209 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 420B 25             COPYMAA
; D 420C 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 420F C9             SEROUT
; D 4210 27             COPYREMA
; D 4211 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4214 C9             SEROUT
; D 4215 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4217 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4219 CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 421B BE 00          RETURN
; POSXY:
; D 421D CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 421F CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4221 4D DF          DIVXY R13 / R15
; D 4223 25             COPYMAA
; D 4224 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4227 C9             SEROUT
; D 4228 27             COPYREMA
; D 4229 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 422C C9             SEROUT
; D 422D CA 3B          SEROUTI 3B ';'
; D 422F 4D EF          DIVXY R14 / R15
; D 4231 25             COPYMAA
; D 4232 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4235 C9             SEROUT
; D 4236 27             COPYREMA
; D 4237 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 423A C9             SEROUT
; D 423B CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 423D BE 00          RETURN

